cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Additive Self-Healing in Lattice Sumsets with Interior Voids"
version: "2.17.0"
date-released: "2026-10-02"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sun"
    given-names: "Scott"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-1095-6228"
abstract: >
  Computational research package for studying additive self-healing
  thresholds h*(A_hole; A_full) in finite lattice sumsets with interior
  void configurations. Implements three independent verification engines
  (pure-set, bitwise, formula) for cross-auditing Conjecture M3' and
  Conjecture 14.3 (Structural Independence).
